     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cause and consequence",
     "texto": [
      "**Δεν αρκεί να…** signals that a measure is not enough. **Προκειμένου να εξασφαλιστεί…** expresses purpose; **κατά συνέπεια** links to the effect.",
      "Notice what relationship each connector sets up and use it to express your own position."
     ],
